443	 * Record a spawn attempt that failed BEFORE a child process existed (unknown
444	 * harness, role validation, cap). Durable visibility for what used to be a
445	 * silent console.warn — the row shows in fleet:tree / the Brew tab with the
446	 * reason in error_message.
